# Scanner Client — Environment Variables

# ── Development ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Leave VITE_API_URL empty so Axios uses relative paths (e.g. /api/auth/login).
# The Vite dev server proxy (vite.config.js) intercepts those requests and
# forwards them to localhost:3000 — no CORS headers needed.
VITE_API_URL=

# ── Production ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Set this to your deployed API origin, e.g.:
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.your-university.edu
